menu "Protocol - Communication Stack"

    config PROTOCOL_LINE_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Line assembly timeout (ms)"
        default 100
        range 10 5000
        help
            Maximum time allowed between the first byte of a line and the
            line terminator (\n).  If a partial line sits in the buffer
            longer than this, it is discarded and error:3 is sent back.
            Default 100ms per PLAN T3 spec.

endmenu
